charset-normalizer-rust: Rust mirror of Ousret/charset_normalizer
=======================================================================

This directory holds the rustsmith Stage-1 mirror of
https://github.com/Ousret/charset_normalizer (charset detection library).

* Upstream authors: Ahmed R. TAHRI
* Upstream license: MIT (SPDX tag carried in every file header).
* This port: behavior-identical, same public API
  (`charset_normalizer._charset_normalizer` extension module plus the
  `charset_normalizer/__init__.py` + `charset_normalizer/__main__.py`
  shims), published as the `charset-normalizer-rust` distribution on PyPI
  (import name unchanged: `import charset_normalizer`) with reusable core
  crate `charset-normalizer-core` on crates.io.

Provenance: every artifact preserves the upstream license header and this
attribution (provenance gate). See `release.toml` for the publishing
configuration and `docs/RELEASE.md` for the release procedure.
